<%- include('components/header') %>
  <img class="mail-image" src="<%= imageUrl %>" alt="Welcome to Memento" />
  <h1 class="subject">You’re in. Welcome to Memento</h1>
  <%- include('components/greetings', { name }) %>
    <p>
      We’re thrilled to have you join the Memento private beta! 🥳 You now have full access to explore, create, and
      reflect freely.
    </p>
    <p>Here’s a few things you can do today:</p>
    <ul style="list-style-position: inside;">
      <li>🌿 Start your first story</li>
      <li>💬 Have a conversation with your AI twin</li>
      <li>🌅 Try a daily reflection prompt</li>
    </ul>

    <p>
      Your journey with Memento begins here - a place built to help you preserve what truly matters. Welcome to the
      beginning of something deeply human.
    </p>

    <%- include('components/closing-text') %>
      <%- include('components/footer') %>